        rdfs:comment                   "The Green Tara, Sakyamuni and Akshobhya; Religion, cotton gouache, painted, Tibet, C18-19"@en , "The figure shown in the centre is the Treen Tara; below her and to the right is the figure of Sakyamuni and to the left a figure of Aksobhya, blue in colour and haolding Vajra in his left hand.   Between the two figurtes is a conch shell on a stand and other symbols.  All three have landscape background with rocks and flowers."@en ;
